<title>USA: Gibbs says on track for $50 mln annl revs.</title>
<headline>Gibbs says on track for $50 mln annl revs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gibbs Construction Inc said Wednesday it has completed negotiations for four construction projects together worth $4.6 million, putting the company on track to post annual revenues of $50 million.</p>
<p>The four sites include Just for Feet stores in Mesquite, Texas and Atlanta; a PETsMART facility in Plano, Texas; and a music store in Minneapolis.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610)).</p>
